SPECIES         TEXTURE/PATTERN         PROPERTIES              USES/NOTES
-----------     --------------------    --------------------    ----------
Alligator       Square scales           Extremely durable;      Highest prestige;
(American)      (belly: rectangular     soft; water resistant;  Hermès Birkin bags;
                uniform; back:          unique scale pattern    CITES regulated;
                round/varied)           varies belly to back    provenance required

Caiman          Regular scales;         Lower grade; less       More affordable
(South American) prominent spine        supple; scale seams     entry point;
                 scale                  can crack               Western goods

Stingray (Shagreen) Mineral pebbled    Extremely hard (1%      Watch straps, card
                surface; distinctive   mineral content);        holders, handles;
                pearl at center        unique texture;          very durable;
                                       water resistant          practical choice

Python          Rectangular scale       Supple; delicate;       Garments, bags;
                with diamond pattern    tears if not backed;    must use backing
                                        beautiful

Shark           Small uniform denticles Very water resistant;   Luxury goods;
                                        tough; distinctive      less common
                                        matte texture
